{
    "title": "Mia World - Makeover Life",
    "description": "Mia World is a dress up and simulate game designed specifically for children, filled with endless possibilities. In this educational game for kids, you can create stories, design your own world, and fill it with characters you collect and customize! \ud83d\udc9e\r\n\r\nThis is an immersive dress up game that lets you \u2018live\u2019 in a multitude of scenes \ud83c\udfe1\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f, rich in interactive items. Choose from a broad range of doll characters and animal costume changes which make every moment exciting.\r\n\r\nLIFE IN MIA WORLD \ud83c\udf0d\r\nMia World is a pearl of everyday simulation. Engage in an array of life scenes, indulge in interactive items - every moment is a saga of dramatic narratives. Tickle your fashion creativity and see your stories come to life!\r\n\r\nDRESS UP TIME \ud83d\udc57\r\nThe educational game allows for doll and animal costume changes! Dive into an endless wardrobe and give your imagination wings. Let\u2019s see who can create a nice look!\r\n\r\nMIA WORLD brings you more than just a educational game for kids; it\u2019s an experiential journey where YOU become a vital part of the story. Embrace the MAGIC of creative energy and the freedom to envision, experiment and experience! \u2728\r\n\r\nEmbrace unmissable fun! Living the dream in Mia World has never been this exciting! Get started and ride the swirl of endless fun! \u2764\ufe0f\r\n\r\nRemember, in Mia world, the only limit is your imagination! Start the journey and live your dream life today! \ud83c\udf1f\r\n\r\n--=\u2261\u03a3((( \u3064`\u2022\u03c9\u2022\u00b4)\u3064\r\n\ud83c\udf89JOIN MIA WORLD\ud83c\udf89\r\nJoin our Discord community to connect with fellow players and share your creations! Click the link to join us and start your adventure: https://discord.gg/yE3xjusazZ\r\nIf you need assistance or have any comments, you're welcome to contact us: support@31gamestudio.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Mia World is a dress up and simulate game designed specifically for children, filled with endless possibilities. In this educational game for kids, you can create stories, design your own world, and fill it with characters you collect and customize! \ud83d\udc9e<br><br>This is an immersive dress up game that lets you \u2018live\u2019 in a multitude of scenes \ud83c\udfe1\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f, rich in interactive items. Choose from a broad range of doll characters and animal costume changes which make every moment exciting.<br><br>LIFE IN MIA WORLD \ud83c\udf0d<br>Mia World is a pearl of everyday simulation. Engage in an array of life scenes, indulge in interactive items - every moment is a saga of dramatic narratives. Tickle your fashion creativity and see your stories come to life!<br><br>DRESS UP TIME \ud83d\udc57<br>The educational game allows for doll and animal costume changes! Dive into an endless wardrobe and give your imagination wings. Let\u2019s see who can create a nice look!<br><br>MIA WORLD brings you more than just a educational game for kids; it\u2019s an experiential journey where YOU become a vital part of the story. Embrace the MAGIC of creative energy and the freedom to envision, experiment and experience! \u2728<br><br>Embrace unmissable fun! Living the dream in Mia World has never been this exciting! Get started and ride the swirl of endless fun! \u2764\ufe0f<br><br>Remember, in Mia world, the only limit is your imagination! Start the journey and live your dream life today! \ud83c\udf1f<br><br>--=\u2261\u03a3((( \u3064`\u2022\u03c9\u2022\u00b4)\u3064<br>\ud83c\udf89JOIN MIA WORLD\ud83c\udf89<br>Join our Discord community to connect with fellow players and share your creations! Click the link to join us and start your adventure: https://discord.gg/yE3xjusazZ<br>If you need assistance or have any comments, you&#39;re welcome to contact us: support@31gamestudio.com",
